---
title: Roasted Asparagus
course: side
servings: 2
time_active: 5
time_total: 20
leftovers: good
tags: [quick]
pairs: [steak-au-poivre-with-miso-mushroom-sauce]
---

Heat the oven to 400°F.

Toss @asparagus{1%lb}(trimmed) with @olive oil{1%tbsp}, @salt, and @black pepper{} on a #baking sheet{}.

Roast until tender-crisp, ~{12-15%minutes}. Finish with @lemon{1}(zested).
